sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant App as Auth App
    participant Srv as Auth Server
    participant OTP as Voice OTP Service
    participant GW as Voice Gateway (Twilio)
    participant Phone as User's Phone

    Note over U,Srv: Triggered after biometric factor succeeds
    App->>Srv: Request voice-call factor
    Srv->>OTP: Generate 6-digit code
    OTP->>OTP: Store salted hash, 5 min TTL, attempt counter = 0
    OTP->>GW: Place call, TwiML script with code
    GW->>Phone: Ring
    Phone->>U: User answers
    GW->>Phone: TTS: reads code digit-by-digit
    opt User presses 1
        Phone->>GW: DTMF "1"
        GW->>Phone: Repeats code
    end
    U->>App: Types code into accessible field
    App->>Srv: Submit entered code
    Srv->>OTP: Verify hash + TTL + attempt counter
    alt Correct and not expired
        OTP-->>Srv: Valid
        Srv-->>App: Factor accepted, issue session
    else Incorrect or expired
        OTP-->>Srv: Invalid (increment counter)
        Srv-->>App: Rejected - offer new call after short delay
    end
